type: software
title: "REVEAL: Retrieval and Evidence-based Validated Interpretation Analysis for gene Lists"
abstract: >-
  REVEAL interprets gene lists with an LLM pipeline that combines local gene databases,
  PubMed literature mining and AI synthesis, for rare disease genomics.
authors:
